{
  "header": {
    "note": "table of cases for internal/store/approval tests"
  },
  "notes": [
    "tree_cases: build tree[] under a temp root, load each group, compare files; replace @ROOT@ with the root in key_template and record_template. Modes are octal strings; symlink targets are relative. content_hex replaces content when the bytes are not UTF-8, path_hex replaces path. A group with error_contains must fail, either to load or when its snapshot is taken, with a message holding that text (@ROOT@ is replaced with the root)."
  ],
